# Online Book Store — frontend environment template
#
# Copy this file to frontend/.env.local (or .env.development.local) and
# adjust the values. All variables must be prefixed with VITE_ to reach
# the browser bundle. They are read in one place: frontend/src/config.ts.

# Base URL of the Django API. The default "/api" works with the Vite dev
# proxy (vite.config.ts) and with the nginx container, which proxies /api/
# to the backend.
#
# Production (Vercel) does NOT need a full URL either: frontend/.env.production
# keeps this at "/api" and frontend/vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the Render
# service server-side. That keeps the API same-origin, which matters because
# the session cookie still keys the GUEST cart and src/api.ts sends
# credentials: "same-origin"; browsers block the third-party cookies a
# cross-origin API would need, so a guest cart would be lost on sign-in.
# Sign-in itself travels as a bearer token and would survive. Set a full URL
# only if you deliberately move to a cross-origin setup with CORS.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# --- Firebase Authentication ---------------------------------------------
#
# Customers sign in with Firebase (email/password or Google), and the ID
# token it issues is what authenticates every API request. Copy these six
# values from the Firebase console: Project settings -> General -> "Your
# apps" -> the web app's SDK setup and configuration.
#
# None of them is a secret. A Firebase web config is published in every
# browser bundle by design; it identifies the project rather than granting
# anything. What protects the project is the Authorized domains list under
# Authentication -> Settings, and the backend verifying every token
# against FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID.
#
# In the Firebase console, enable both sign-in providers under
# Authentication -> Sign-in method: "Email/Password" and "Google".
#
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID in backend/.env must be the same project id as
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID here, or the backend will reject every token.
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
